HourBoostr Remastered by Otter is a modified continuation of HourBoostr by Ezzpify.

Remaster creator reference: https://steamcommunity.com/id/pornhub_sex5/
Original project: https://github.com/Ezzpify/HourBoostr
Original developer: Ezzpify. Upstream contributors: rpges and Kasp42.
Remaster repository: https://github.com/otter-supremacy/HourBoostr-Remastered
